1","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"负面/谨慎","stance":"2026年随着产能扩张，组件成本平均预计下降约16%；成本下降有利普及，但也可能令供应商面临降价和利润率压力。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-43d72e756fdf-004","view_date":"2026-01-21","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"方向预测","stance":"MS估计全球人形机器人市场2040年约2万亿美元，组件市场约7,800亿美元；其中组件市场是产业长期潜在空间。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-43d72e756fdf-003","view_date":"2026-01-21","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"正面","stance":"中国供应商在产业链多个环节具备竞争位置，组件供给扩容有望受益于全球部署。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-43d72e756fdf-002","view_date":"2026-01-21","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"方向预测","stance":"预计中国人形机器人2026年对外交付约2.8万台，约为前一年两倍，但多数仍是小规模验证和试用订单。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-43d72e756fdf-001","view_date":"2026-01-21","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"正面","stance":"2026年是人形机器人集成商争取商业化的关键年；调研显示用户采用意愿较强，有利于更快验证用例并启动初期采用。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"DEEP-g4q3AGcFpbA-004","view_date":"2026-01-16","source_type":"video","source_subtype":"transcript_review_v2","tone":"正面","stance":"正面","attribution":"会议发言候选","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"DEEP-5agYcB-AqB4-027","view_date":"2026-01-06","source_type":"video","source_subtype":"transcript_review_v2","tone":"条件性","stance":"条件性","attribution":"会议发言候选","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-48c0f7e917b1-006","view_date":"2025-12-21","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"混合","stance":"电动化与自动驾驶互相促进：EV降低软件与传感器集成门槛，自动驾驶又提高电动车的使用价值；全球EV渗透与中国供应链规模是关键支撑。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-48c0f7e917b1-005","view_date":"2025-12-21","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"条件性","stance":"纯视觉自动驾驶的长期安全表现取决于模型能否从真实里程持续学习并显著降低事故率；报告以“每日交通死亡数”作示意目标，并非业绩预测。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-48c0f7e917b1-004","view_date":"2025-12-21","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"混合","stance":"激光雷达冗余方案与纯视觉低成本方案是两种竞争路线：Waymo硬件栈成本更高，Tesla路线依赖视觉模型随行驶数据持续改进。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-48c0f7e917b1-003","view_date":"2025-12-21","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"混合","stance":"Waymo正通过新增城市快速扩张，Tesla的Robotaxi则处于启动阶段；未来增长取决于城市运营许可、利用率及单位经济性。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-48c0f7e917b1-002","view_date":"2025-12-21","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"正面","stance":"报告判断中国在自动驾驶竞争中领先，估计中国约占全球自动驾驶市场份额60%，并列举多家中国运营商和生态企业。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-48c0f7e917b1-001","view_date":"2025-12-21","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"方向预测","stance":"L4/L5自动驾驶将缓慢起步、长期渗透；MS估计全球自动驾驶车辆2030年220万、2040年2.45亿、2050年7.22亿辆。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"JDJ-ffHA9U4Ncck-02","view_date":"2025-12-15","source_type":"video","source_subtype":"transcript_review_v2","tone":"方向预测","stance":"directional forecast","attribution":"会议发言候选","related_asset_ids":["industry:trade","industry:robotics","industry:solar"],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"JDJ-5ZDjpv35BMU-01","view_date":"2025-12-10","source_type":"video","source_subtype":"transcript_review_v2","tone":"混合","stance":"mixed","attribution":"会议发言候选","related_asset_ids":["industry:robotics","industry:auto"],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-801bd5a32746-006","view_date":"2025-12-07","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"混合","stance":"美国自动驾驶市场由Waymo扩城与Tesla布局推动，但不同公司的传感器架构、运营模式和规模路径有差异。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-801bd5a32746-005","view_date":"2025-12-07","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"正面","stance":"电动车可作为数据采集探针，自动驾驶能力提升可增强电动车产品价值；但报告认为西方难以在不依赖中国的情况下同时实现低成本、盈利和规模。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-801bd5a32746-004","view_date":"2025-12-07","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"混合","stance":"激光雷达与纯视觉方案可能长期并存，各自适合不同成本、安全冗余和部署场景；“先行者”不必然获得最终规模优势。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-801bd5a32746-003","view_date":"2025-12-07","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"正面","stance":"报告认为中国可能先引领自动驾驶规模化，估计其约占全球自动驾驶市场份额60%，并强调中国电动车生态、成本和数据基础优势。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-801bd5a32746-002","view_date":"2025-12-07","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"方向预测","stance":"自动驾驶L4/L5车辆预测呈“前期缓慢、长期扩张”：全球在用规模估计2030年220万、2040年2.45亿、2050年7.22亿辆。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"PDF-801bd5a32746-001","view_date":"2025-12-07","source_type":"report","source_subtype":"local_pdf","tone":"方向预测","stance":"报告提出机器人将进入多形态扩张期，AI由数字世界走向物理应用，自动驾驶、人形及服务机器人形成多条应用路径。","attribution":"研报作者","related_asset_ids":[],"detail_file":"data/opinions-a3581564bbfaa008.json"},{"id":"JDJ-vWP-gl5Px6c-03","view_date":"2025-12-04","source_type":"video","source_subtype":"transcript_review_v2","tone":"混合","stance":"m